# Uncertainty Preservation Engine

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-uncertainty-preservation.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-uncertainty-preservation.md)

## Principle

Separate **what happened** from **why**.  
Never: Observation → Diagnosis · Correlation → Cause.

## Store

Facts + possible relationships + unknowns — **never** conclusions as facts.

## Caregiver sees

What we know · What may be connected · What remains unclear  
Never confidence % · never “medication caused…” · never disease-progression theater

## Acceptance

“Confused after medication changed” → timing held, cause unclear — **not** “medication caused confusion.”

